    {
      "name": "places/ChIJK2gSTIvtaS4R4nAoN8P2e_o/reviews/ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUN1cGJYc0hBEAE",
      "relativePublishTimeDescription": "4 years ago",
      "rating": 5,
      "text": {
        "text": "Hidden gem!! This place is awesome! So quite and peaceful. It’ll be one of the best place for healing although the foods and beverages are quite expensive but totally worth to try, specially the coffee and snack. Black and berries coffee and Banana Fritter is highly recommended! Not many selections for the main course unfortunately. I ordered beef black pepper and the taste was so so. Overall, it’s 5 ⭐️!! Ps: Near by the place, there is a mosque for praying and the smells sooo good inside and very clean.",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
      "originalText": {
        "text": "Hidden gem!! This place is awesome! So quite and peaceful. It’ll be one of the best place for healing although the foods and beverages are quite expensive but totally worth to try, specially the coffee and snack. Black and berries coffee and Banana Fritter is highly recommended! Not many selections for the main course unfortunately. I ordered beef black pepper and the taste was so so. Overall, it’s 5 ⭐️!! Ps: Near by the place, there is a mosque for praying and the smells sooo good inside and very clean.",
        "languageCode": "en"
