    {
      "name": "places/ChIJK2gSTIvtaS4R4nAoN8P2e_o/reviews/ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURwOVBQVE9BEAE",
      "relativePublishTimeDescription": "3 years ago",
      "rating": 5,
      "text": {
        "text": "Hidden Gems. The view of the river is nice, lots of greenery too.\nLocated at house complex, easy to find, the front row is quite tight but there is not much car back and forth in this area so it's still easy to reach.\n\nCoffee is good. Food and snack also Oke.\n\nParking is available for 3 SUV and motorcycles.",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
      "originalText": {
