    {
      "name": "places/ChIJK2gSTIvtaS4R4nAoN8P2e_o/reviews/ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUN1NGVqTmRnEAE",
      "relativePublishTimeDescription": "4 years ago",
      "rating": 5,
      "text": {
        "text": "A friendly hidden gem just right at the corner of Kali Ciliwung. Seneng banget tempat sekewl ini ada di deket rumah.one of a kind cos it offer a riverside view, which maybe the one and only even in east Jakarta. A reviewer recommend the chese baked peyeum and it taste so nice meski for some people a bit too sweet. I have tried 2 of their mocktails its truly selatan quality👍im sooo enjoy this cafe and would come back for work!",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
      "originalText": {
