    {
      "name": "places/ChIJK2gSTIvtaS4R4nAoN8P2e_o/reviews/ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUMzbHBLenp3RRAB",
      "relativePublishTimeDescription": "a year ago",
      "rating": 5,
      "text": {
        "text": "Redsoldadu Riverside in Cijantung is a charming oasis with a picturesque riverside setting that makes it perfect for a relaxing day out.\n\nThe surprise element? Their carefully selected cutlery, glasses, and tableware, add a touch of elegance to the experience.\n\nDon’t miss out on their surprisingly delightful mocktails.\n\nPlus, there’s a mushola nestled in the surroundings, offering a serene escape that feels like another nature experience—definitely a refreshing break from the usual Jakarta vibe.",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
      "originalText": {
        "text": "Redsoldadu Riverside in Cijantung is a charming oasis with a picturesque riverside setting that makes it perfect for a relaxing day out.\n\nThe surprise element? Their carefully selected cutlery, glasses, and tableware, add a touch of elegance to the experience.\n\nDon’t miss out on their surprisingly delightful mocktails.\n\nPlus, there’s a mushola nestled in the surroundings, offering a serene escape that feels like another nature experience—definitely a refreshing break from the usual Jakarta vibe.",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
