    {
      "name": "places/ChIJK2gSTIvtaS4R4nAoN8P2e_o/reviews/ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUMtZ091OGFREAE",
      "relativePublishTimeDescription": "3 years ago",
      "rating": 5,
      "text": {
        "text": "5 starts for the environment, design, cleanliness and the vibes\nPlaylist need to be updated, kinda bored with the sigur ros dark ala mode, i prefer chill relax and more uplifting\nI order spaghetti bolognese (too salty, too oily, 2 out 5), honey wings (nice), ice cappucino (acceptable), ice lychee (the glass is tiny), they charge 5000 for ice in a small glass thats sadly dissapointing\nToilet is clean but the stairs is challenging for seniors or kids and no safety factor within toilet perimeter (adjacent to the riverside)\nOverall it is truly a hidden gem, will visit again for the torenggeng and trees sounds",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
      "originalText": {
